{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"89f250018767b7cb4bb24643ad2319c4bfdfd472b6a2cac82651bcb641ac45b8","ja":"また次も","zh":"下次也要","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"76e3c3eb9b5d7d6e1cd839a87901188f16858542c2e37060f3ccff34c1917d4e","ja":"アフタヌーンティーを楽しんだふたりは\nその後、観覧車へ……","zh":"享用过下午茶的两人\n之后前往了摩天轮……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ba1ed07caa5274ec77670a804321e4a8136ca83b3a3d729f32d5e458d81903f5","ja":"わあ～♪　見て見て、まつり！\n夕日がすっごくきれいだぞ～！","zh":"哇～♪　快看快看，茉莉！\n夕阳超级漂亮哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"48498b12096a3260000163a1e2d7756e05b645179a7307cd1bf44d756f5daacf","ja":"いつも乗っている姫には、一番きれいな景色が\n見れるタイミングが分かるのですよ♪","zh":"经常乘坐的公主，可是很清楚什么时候\n能看到最美的景色哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0fc0784e6a3e98c4466c22b371e264caa5292d7cb9c1962bca9b93a802b123e3","ja":"そうなんだ……\nなんだかお姫さまの休日ってすごいね！","zh":"这样啊……\n总觉得公主的休息日好厉害呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dafbbedf132778ec3fd499d2400ff71466f59d73284fc0101ce17a53f73d39ff","ja":"ねえまつり、他には\nお休みの日にどんなことしてるの？","zh":"我说茉莉，除了这些\n你休息日还会做些什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"115f6b5529a5d0cff7382da17c918b06ec82f220f2d329ed2aa9e1f37d7e55c6","ja":"お城の妖精さんと森でピクニックをしたり、\n海でウミウシさんと歌ったりしてるのです♪","zh":"和城堡的小妖精在森林里野餐，\n在海里和小海蛞蝓一起唱歌呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0e27181f971c8f60e97de4d277e10f8b3ad22c435840c8f66c536d831a634d10","ja":"わあ～！　すっごく楽しそう！","zh":"哇～！看起来好好玩！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fc7dd81e0f550ccf7fbe73d04d63f8c95b7a1a710e5876bb0ac6d588361c9c7a","ja":"たまき、またまつりと一緒に\nお姫さまのお休みをやりたいぞ！","zh":"环还想再和茉莉一起\n当公主休息呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"380c9e4bdf4c90986b5ebe5eac14caf9bf8066dff4fbb407ab2401304e7ed85e","ja":"今度は、お城に行って妖精さんに会って……。\nあと、馬車にも乗りたいな！","zh":"下次想去城堡见见小妖精……\n还有，也想坐坐马车呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"80b1adbdb45c19196ab8c5a2b1591e6641987df43732d9cafd232a2250739316","ja":"そ、そうですね！\n姫も、また環ちゃんと休日を過ごしたいのです。","zh":"是、是这样呢！\n公主也想再和小环一起度过假日呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"da25b023415e386a4f569a30711ffcb212702f56632922567ec36cd9ed113d1b","ja":"だからまた、番組で密着してくれるように、\r\nみなさんにお願いするのですよ。","zh":"所以还要拜托大家，\n让节目能够再次跟拍呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e898554113ac5774d1df5a8e7a3cd23601740c61b1bdecaf5bc4a1dc30a2ed26","ja":"わかった！　……ねえ、テレビの前のみんな、\nたまきたち、面白かった？","zh":"知道了！……呐，电视机前的各位，\n环她们，有趣吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1055.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"490be3d91c896e035e588961862c8f4943957d3071a10c6551d85c75a424da9a","ja":"たまき、また密着してほしいから、\nいっぱい応援してくれると嬉しいぞ！　くふふっ♪","zh":"环还想被贴身贴身呢，\n要是能多多支持环的话，环会很高兴的哦！嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
